📗
  🚿 Where a streamed response writes its chunks. A handler gets one from
  🌊🐇📬 and calls it as often as it likes:

    🌊🐇📬 🔤text/event-stream🔤 🍇🎍🥡 writer 🚿
      💬 writer 🔤data: hello❌n❌n🔤❗️
    🍉❗️

  Both methods return 👍 while the client is still there. Once one has
  returned 👎 the client is gone, and the producer should stop.
📗
🌍 🐊 🚿 🍇
  📗 Writes *text* as one chunk. 📗
  ❗️ 💬 text 🔡 ➡️ 👌

  📗 Writes *data* as one chunk. 📗
  ❗️ 📇 data 📇 ➡️ 👌
🍉

📗 A 🚿 that collects a stream in memory, for in-memory dispatch and tests. 📗
